   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The pronoun EN",
     "texto": [
      "**En** replaces a complement introduced by **de** or a partitive article **du/de la/de l'/des**: **Je parle de ce film** → **J'en parle**; **Je mange du pain** → **J'en mange**.",
      "It also replaces a quantity; the number comes at the end: **Tu as des frères ?** → **Oui, j'en ai deux**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Where it goes",
     "texto": [
      "Like the other pronouns, **en** goes **before the verb**: **Tu en manges ?** (do you eat some?), **J'en ai trois** (I have three)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Quantity and «de»",
